            "review_text": "Ngoc Anh T\n1 contribution\n0\nYoshino Restaurant\nOct 2026 • Business\nGreat food, great atmosphere. Carol, Nana, Stella, and Lucie provided us with great service and made sure we had a wonderful lunch.\nWritten October 9, 2026\nLOTTE HOTEL SAIGON\nDear ngocanht761,\n\nThank you for your wonderful review of Yoshino Restaurant! We are delighted to hear that you enjoyed the delicious food and pleasant atmosphere. It is especially rewarding to know that Carol, Nana, Stella, and Lucie provided you with excellent service and helped make your lunch such a memorable experience. We will be sure to share your kind compliments with them.\n\nWe truly appreciate your support and look forward to welcoming you back to Yoshino Restaurant for another delightful dining experience.\n\nBest regards,\nHotel Management\nRead more\nWritten October 13, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
