            "review_text": "Hieu N\n1 contribution\n0\nGood meals\nApr 2025 • Business\nThe service and meal is very good. And the person who served us was named Lucie, I think, and she did a great job. The atmosphere looks nice as well.\nWritten April 11, 2025\nLOTTE HOTEL SAIGON\nDear 65hieun,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your kind feedback.\n\nWe’re delighted to hear that you enjoyed both the meal and the service during your visit. It’s wonderful to know that Lucie left a positive impression — we’ll be sure to pass along your kind words to her. We're also glad you appreciated the ambiance of our venue.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back for another enjoyable experience soon.\n\nWarmest regards,\nHotel Management\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
